1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,000
Luis was born and raised in a crowded neighborhood in Mexico City.

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:07,000
His parents worked multiple jobs just to put food on the table,

3
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:10,000
and school was often an afterthought.

4
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:16,000
By the age of 16, Luis dropped out of high school to work full-time as a janitor in an office building,

5
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:21,000
determined to support his younger siblings after their father became too ill to work.

6
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:25,000
But Luis carried something powerful inside, ambition.

7
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:28,000
After mopping floors and cleaning bathrooms all day,

8
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:33,000
he would sit in a supply closet with a battered second-hand laptop and borrowed textbooks.

9
00:00:33,000 --> 00:00:40,000
He taught himself basic math, English, and later physics using free online tutorials.

10
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:43,000
Most nights, he barely slept.

11
00:00:43,000 --> 00:00:47,000
His coworkers didn't understand why he bothered, but Luis kept going.

12
00:00:47,000 --> 00:00:54,000
One day, a software engineer in the building noticed him reading a coding manual and offered to help.

13
00:00:54,000 --> 00:00:57,000
That small gesture became a turning point.

14
00:00:57,000 --> 00:01:03,000
With mentorship and relentless self-study, Luis passed his high school equivalency exam.

15
00:01:03,000 --> 00:01:10,000
He earned a scholarship to a local community college where he excelled and later transferred to a university.

16
00:01:10,000 --> 00:01:15,000
Years of effort paid off, Luis graduated with a degree in mechanical engineering.

17
00:01:15,000 --> 00:01:20,000
Today, he works for a multinational tech company designing sustainable engines

18
00:01:20,000 --> 00:01:24,000
and mentors students from low-income backgrounds.

19
00:01:24,000 --> 00:01:28,000
Luis visits his old office building once a year, not to clean floors,

20
00:01:28,000 --> 00:01:31,000
but to give talks to the janitorial staff.

21
00:01:31,000 --> 00:01:32,000
His message?

22
00:01:32,000 --> 00:01:35,000
Where you start doesn't define where you can go.

23
00:01:35,000 --> 00:01:39,000
With grit and learning, you can build your own future.

